  "name": "Aubergine Milanese",
  "subtitle": "Crisp breaded aubergine with tomato spaghetti",
  "description": "Breaded aubergine quarters are fried until crisp and served with spaghetti tossed in a quick tomato, caper, and herb sauce.",
